{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "err0000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Heteroskedasticity and serial correlation\nStart with the regression target and the information being conditioned on. Unequal conditional variances and nonzero cross-period covariances are separate features. Diagnostics provide evidence; inference, efficient estimation and dynamic modelling have different requirements.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# 异方差与自相关 · 学习总图\n先明确回归目标与条件信息，再区分条件方差不等和跨期协方差非零。诊断提供线索；推断、有效估计与动态建模各有条件。\n\n**课程入口：** [[02_Economy/01_Econometrics/07_异方差.md|异方差正文]] → [[02_Economy/01_Econometrics/08_自相关.md|误差自相关正文]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 5480,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[零条件均值无偏性]]\n\n$E(u\\mid X)=0$ 控制 OLS 估计误差的中心；它与方差是否恒定是不同假设。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[经典 Gauss–Markov 定理|The spherical-error guarantee]]\n\nWith finite second moments, a full-column-rank fixed design and zero error mean, $\\Omega=\\sigma^2I$ gives the classical covariance and BLUE guarantee. A particular nonspherical model can also have BLUE OLS.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限二阶矩、固定满列秩设计与零误差均值下，球形协方差给出经典方差与 BLUE 保证。这是充分条件；特定非球形模型中的 OLS 也可能仍是 BLUE。",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[标准误口径匹配|Matching the covariance estimator]]\nChoose HC, HAC or clustering from the design and dependence structure, with the required sample-size regime and reference law. A larger robust standard error is not guaranteed, and an apparently more significant result is not a selection rule.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[标准误口径匹配]]\n按设计与依赖结构选择 HC、HAC 或聚类，并核对相应样本增长条件及参考分布。稳健标准误未必更大，也不能按哪个结果更显著来挑选。",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[自协方差与ACF]]\n\nACF 描述序列的滞后相关；回归诊断只关心均值方程之后剩余的误差结构。",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[Ljung-Box检验]]\n\n联合检验选定窗口内多个残差自相关；拟合模型后要按实现调整自由度。",
      "x": 4320,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[聚类标准误边界|Cluster-robust inference]]\n\nChoose clusters from the design and dependence mechanism. Standard one-way theory needs many conditionally independent clusters plus regularity; few clusters or dominance by a few clusters can invalidate its approximation. Arbitrary cross-cluster dependence is outside that model.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n按设计与依赖机制选簇。常规单向聚类理论需要大量条件独立簇及正则条件；簇少或少数簇主导时近似可能失效。不能允许任意跨簇依赖。",
      "x": 4940,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[异方差|Heteroskedasticity]]\nConditional error variance changes with the stated information. A correct mean and iid sampling of complete observations can coexist with it. Unequal diagonal variances do not by themselves imply cross-observation dependence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[异方差]]\n给定信息后的误差方差随信息改变。均值正确、完整观测 iid 抽样，都可以与异方差并存；对角方差不等本身不说明观测间依赖。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[协方差失效下的OLS|OLS with nonspherical errors]]\n\nFor a fixed full-column-rank design and finite second moments, zero conditional error mean preserves OLS unbiasedness, not automatically consistency. Nonspherical covariance generally removes the classical variance and BLUE guarantees; particular designs may retain them. A familiar covariance formula does not itself validate the residual variance estimate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定满列秩设计与有限二阶矩下，零条件误差均值保留 OLS 无偏性，不自动推出一致性。非球形协方差一般使经典方差与 BLUE 失去保证，特定设计仍可能保留；公式恰巧相同也不保证残差方差估计有效。",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "err000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[误差序列相关|Serial correlation in errors]]\nErrors at different dates have nonzero covariance relative to the stated information. Equal variances do not rule it out. Fitting can correlate residuals even when errors are independent; a persistent outcome alone is not a diagnosis.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[误差序列相关]]\n在指定条件信息下，不同时点误差的协方差非零。同方差不排除序列相关；误差独立时拟合也可能使残差相关，结果变量有持续性也不能单独诊断误差。",
      "x": 3080,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "err000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[残差协方差诊断|Residual scale and dependence]]\nFitting transforms the errors: residual variances and correlations can differ even under spherical errors. Inspect actual order, predictors, leverage and sampling units. Curvature, scale changes and dependence have competing explanations; a pattern is a clue, not a unique diagnosis.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[残差协方差诊断]]\n拟合会变换误差：误差球形时，残差也可能方差不等且相关。结合真实顺序、解释变量、杠杆与抽样单位检查；曲率、尺度变化和依赖各有竞争解释，图案是线索，不是唯一诊断。",
      "x": 2180,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "err000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Breusch-Pagan检验|Breusch–Pagan / Koenker]]\nRegress squared residuals on prespecified variance predictors. Normal-theory BP and studentized Koenker use different scales; report the version and effective rank. The chi-squared comparison needs sampling, moment and design conditions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[Breusch-Pagan检验]]\n平方残差对预定方差变量回归。正态 BP 与学生化 Koenker 使用不同尺度；报告版本和有效秩。卡方比较还需抽样、矩与设计条件。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "err000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[White异方差检验|White test]]\nUse nonredundant predictors, squares and products. Degrees of freedom follow actual rank. The usual nR² calibration needs more than equal variances; a wrong mean can also make squared residuals predictable. Testing and HC covariance estimation are different operations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[White异方差检验]]\n使用去重后的解释变量、平方和乘积，自由度按实际秩确定。常见 nR² 校准不只要求方差相等；错误均值也能使平方残差可预测。检验与 HC 协方差估计各有职责。",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "err000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Durbin-Watson检验|Durbin–Watson]]\nCompare successive residual differences with total residual size. The exact identity includes endpoints; near two does not prove zero error correlation. Classical calibration depends on the design and Gaussian spherical-null conditions; ordinary tables generally fail with lagged outcomes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[Durbin-Watson检验]]\n比较相邻残差变化与总残差大小。精确恒等式含首尾修正，接近二不证明误差零相关。经典校准依赖设计及正态球形零假设；含滞后因变量时普通表一般失效。",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "err000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Breusch-Godfrey检验|Breusch–Godfrey]]\nRetain original regressors and test a prechosen lag window. Record actual auxiliary rows, initialization and rank. The nR² law is asymptotic, requires valid model and moment conditions, and is not generally robust to conditional heteroskedasticity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[Breusch-Godfrey检验]]\n保留原回归量，检验预定滞后窗口。记录实际辅助样本、初始处理和秩。nR² 依赖有效模型与矩条件下的渐近参考，一般不抵抗条件异方差。",
      "x": 4320,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n### Interpret the tested restrictions\nRejection challenges a null together with its maintained assumptions; it does not identify an economic cause or automatically choose HC, HAC or GLS. Nonrejection does not verify the model. Return to the target and the proposed generating mechanism.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n### 解释被检验的限制\n拒绝针对零假设连同维持假设，不能识别经济原因，也不自动选出 HC、HAC 或 GLS。未拒绝不验证模型；应回到估计对象与生成机制。",
      "x": 2180,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[异方差稳健协方差|Heteroskedasticity-robust covariance]]\nIn the independent-observation setting, HC uses squared residual contributions while retaining OLS coefficients. HC0–HC3 differ in finite-sample adjustments; HC alone does not cover serial or within-cluster dependence. Report the variant and calibration.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[异方差稳健协方差|HC 协方差]]\n在观测独立的设定下，HC 用平方残差贡献估计协方差，保留 OLS 系数。HC0–HC3 的有限样本修正不同；仅用 HC 不涵盖时间或组内依赖，应报告版本与校准。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[加权最小二乘|Weighted least squares]]\nWeight squared residuals by positive row weights. With full column rank and finite second moments, known inverse relative variances give BLUE for a correct linear mean and uncorrelated errors. Transform every column, including the intercept. Arbitrary weights do not inherit that efficiency guarantee.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[加权最小二乘|WLS]]\n用正权重衡量残差平方。满列秩与有限二阶矩下，线性均值正确且误差不相关时，已知相对方差的倒数支持 BLUE 比较；整行变换包含截距。任意权重不自动继承该效率保证。",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[广义最小二乘|Generalized least squares]]\nUse a known positive definite covariance shape, including cross-covariances. Whitening gives equal variances and zero covariances; independence needs an extra distributional argument. GLS is BLUE under full column rank and the stated mean and moment conditions, with possible ties.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[广义最小二乘|GLS]]\n使用已知正定协方差形状及交叉协方差。白化得到等方差与零协方差；独立还需分布论证。满列秩及给定均值与矩条件下 GLS 为 BLUE，允许并列最优。",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可行GLS|Feasible GLS]]\nEstimate a structured positive definite covariance model, then refit. Same-sample estimated weights need a new statistical argument: consistency and first-order GLS equivalence have additional conditions. Misspecification may lose efficiency or invalidate model-based standard errors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[可行GLS|FGLS]]\n估计有结构的正定协方差模型，再重拟合。同样本估计权重需另作统计论证；一致性与一阶 GLS 等价各有额外条件。错设可能损失效率或使模型标准误失效。",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[AR1准差分|AR(1) quasi-differencing]]\nTransform the entire equation, including its intercept. With known |ρ|<1 and the specified stationary initial covariance, Prais–Winsten rescales the first row; Cochrane–Orcutt drops only the first transformed equation. Estimated ρ needs separate FGLS justification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[AR1准差分]]\n整条方程连同截距一起变换。已知 |ρ|<1 且满足指定平稳初始协方差时，Prais–Winsten 缩放首行；Cochrane–Orcutt 只丢第一条变换方程。估计 ρ 还需另作 FGLS 论证。",
      "x": 2480,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[HAC协方差|HAC / Newey–West]]\nKeep OLS coefficients and estimate long-run uncertainty from lagged residual contributions in one ordered series. Consistency needs moment, dependence and bandwidth conditions. A fixed bandwidth can miss the target; ordinary HAC is not justified by stacking panel rows.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[HAC协方差|HAC / Newey–West]]\n保留 OLS 系数，用一条有序序列中滞后残差贡献估计长期不确定性。一致性需要矩、依赖和带宽条件；固定带宽可能漏掉目标，把面板串行也不能为普通 HAC 辩护。",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[误差协方差决策|Choosing a covariance method]]\nState the target and information units first: a descriptive projection, a conditional mean and a causal effect make different claims. HC/HAC/clustering change uncertainty; WLS/GLS change the fit and can change a projection target. Match the covariance model and reference law to the design.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[误差协方差决策]]\n先明确目标和信息单位：描述性投影、条件均值和因果效应承担不同主张。HC/HAC/聚类改变不确定性；WLS/GLS 改变拟合，也可能改变投影目标。协方差模型与参考分布都须匹配设计。",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 2390,
      "width": 1740,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "err0000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 邻接出口：[[条件异方差：ARCH 与 GARCH.canvas|ARCH / GARCH]]\n\n误差水平可以不相关，而平方冲击仍可预测。条件波动是独立专题，不是普通序列相关的通用补救。",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 2390,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
